{"body": "Tasks 25-27 done: 21 coach-side functional tests. Found 3 real bugs, all fixed: (1) TrainerCoachAssociationRepository missing 'use App\\Entity\\User' causing TypeError on entire coach HTTP surface, (2) findActiveFor() left association.invitation as a lazy proxy that collided with findForTrainer()'s independent load of the same row (third occurrence of the readonly-id-on-proxy-init crash) - fixed with leftJoin+addSelect, (3) CoachInvitationController::accept() called resolve() unconditionally, making the idempotent re-follow-own-accepted-link path unreachable through the real route - restructured to route signed-in already-accepted visitors through accept() instead. 220 tests green.", "created_at": "2026-08-20T11:33:55.130978+00:00", "from_actor": "test-generator", "id": "4305263a-75dd-4525-b662-b435af413d12", "refs": [], "schema_version": 1, "seq": 18, "task_id": "0ce7a557-37a1-410f-b472-61ea841f5b3b", "task_revision": 9, "to_actor": "main", "type": "completion"}
